{
 "encounter_id": "00940",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mrs Thackeray? Is that Moira, or Maureen? I've two on the list this morning. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Moira, love. Maureen's my sister, she's the one with the hip. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Moira it is. So, what can I do for you today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, I'm after a check on my tablet, the omeprazole, for the heartburn. It's due, they sent me a text."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Tell me how you take it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "One a day, 20 milligrams, I think. Maybe 40? The box is at home. In the morning, before breakfast, when I remember."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When you remember. How often do you forget?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, the odd day. A few days a week, perhaps. I put it by the kettle, but then I have my tea and off I go."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for being honest. Is that the only tablet you take? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's the only one, yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now, I see here a note on your allergies. Can you tell me about that?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. Years ago, I came out in a rash, all over my back. The doctor said never again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's very clear. Anything else in your medical history I should know about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The reflux, of course, and the blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is the blood pressure treated? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "With diet, they said. Less salt. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. And how are you getting on generally? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, can't complain. Busy, you know. I've got the grandchildren Tuesdays. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely. Let me check your numbers. Pulse 70, blood pressure 130 over 78, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 14, weight 71 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very good. Let me feel your tummy.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cold hands. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your abdomen is soft. And there's no tenderness at the top of the tummy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So the reflux sounds well controlled."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It has been, yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How about the number of tablets you miss? Do you think we could change the routine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Put it with my toothbrush? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's an excellent idea. Brush, then tablet, then breakfast. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll try that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll check the pharmacy record for the exact dose, because 20 and 40 are quite different. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'd hate to be on the wrong one. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else you wanted to talk about? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, that's it, love. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. I'd like to see you again in three months to review it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three months. I'll put it in my diary. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely. Look after yourself, Moira. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And you, love. Give my best to the nurse. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right, that's me. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Bye for now. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bye bye. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take care. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cheerio. ~"
  }
 ],
